<title>HONG KONG: Chung Hwa year profit jumps 119.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Chung Hwa year profit jumps 119.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   6.4    vs 3.0 (adjusted)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs 2.63 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    30.32  vs 13.83</p>
<p>    Turnover		     176.62 vs 128.86</p>
<p>    Company name		 Chung Hwa Development Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 21-27</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - A packaging company.</p>
<p>The company proposed a 4-for-5 bonus share issue.</p>
<p>Comparative share earnings has been adjusted for the bonus share issue of 1995.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
